<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets United Micro Elec warrants.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets United Micro Elec warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Wednesday it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on United Micro Electronics Corp.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    NT$70.5	 PREMIUM	   16 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     NT$11.28	GEARING	   6.25X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	16.OCT.97     PAYDATE	   05.MAY.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE NT$70.5	 LISTING DATE    TO BE DETERMINED</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> NOTES	     CASH SETTLEMENT</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
